-- ============================================================
-- Alonecraft 4.61 -- Rogue / Subtlety, part 4 of 6
--   Tricks of the Trade -> can be self-cast
-- ============================================================
--
-- TODO.md:
--   "Tricks of the Trade: Can be self-cast. When self-cast it also
--    increases dodge chance by 20% of your crit chance and doubles threat."
--
--
-- WHY THE CAST WAS REJECTED (57934)
--
--   AttributesEx carried SPELL_ATTR1_EXCLUDE_CASTER (0x00080000, "Cannot be
--   self-cast"), checked in SpellInfo.cpp:1655.  Clearing that bit is the
--   whole fix: 67634208 -> 67109920.
--
--   The implicit target (57, TARGET_UNIT_TARGET_RAID) does NOT need
--   changing -- Unit::IsInRaidWith returns true for the caster itself
--   (Unit.cpp:15112), so once the attribute is gone the rogue is a legal
--   target.  Leaving the target type alone keeps the ally case, and the
--   core script spell_rog_tricks_of_the_trade (spell_rogue.cpp:619) with
--   it, exactly as it is.
--
--
-- THE SELF-CAST BUFF (200500)
--
--   Built from 57933, the ally damage buff, purely as a field template.
--
--     Effect1  MOD_DODGE_PERCENT (49)   amount filled in by C++
--     Effect2  MOD_THREAT (10) +100%    EffectMiscValue 127 = all schools
--
--   The dodge amount is 20% of the rogue's current crit chance, which is
--   not expressible in the DBC, so it is left at zero here and computed by
--   spell_rog_tricks_self (RogueTricksOfTheTrade.cpp).  That script also
--   runs a 2 s recalculation heartbeat so the value tracks gear and buff
--   changes instead of freezing at whatever the crit chance was when the
--   buff landed.
--
--   Duration moves from index 32 (6 s) to index 9 (30 s) so the self-cast
--   buff lasts as long as 57934's own redirect window rather than the much
--   shorter after-attack window of the ally buff.
--
--   SpellFamilyFlags1 is zeroed.  57933 carries bit 26, and inheriting a
--   real Tricks of the Trade family bit would let Filthy Tricks' cooldown
--   and cost modifiers match this buff as well.
--
-- ============================================================


